title=t('多一年實習，值得嗎？英國三明治學位的三筆帳','Is an extra placement year worthwhile? Three accounts for a UK sandwich degree')
desc=t('Peter以能力、現金與時間檢視實習價值；Bath與Surrey官方規則顯示，錄取學位並不保證實習職位。','Peter weighs skills, cash and time. Bath and Surrey’s guidance shows that admission to a degree does not guarantee a placement.')
pairs=[('Peter於11月7日的新文提醒家庭，三明治學位是把職場學習納入課程，不是學校保證安排工作。本文為已核對改編，保留原文的能力、現金與時間三個面向；文中示例不是本刊採訪的真實學生。','Peter’s November 7 post describes a sandwich degree as work-based learning within a course, not a guaranteed job. This verified adaptation retains the skills, cash and time framework. Illustrative students are not interview subjects.'),('Bath管理學院的官方說明列四年制課程第三年12個月實習，也明說職缺與薪資不保證。Surrey則說明本科生第二年開始申請，職位由雇主甄選；學校提供準備與求職支持，不能替代個別錄取。','Bath’s School of Management describes a twelve-month third-year placement in its four-year courses, without guaranteeing a position or pay. Surrey says undergraduate applications start in year two and employers select candidates. University preparation and careers support do not replace an employer’s offer.'),('Peter的能力帳關注任務、指導與成果；現金帳包含住宿、搬家、通勤和求職成本，薪資以實際聘書為準；時間帳則比較探索職涯的價值與延後畢業的成本。這是教育觀點，不是經計算證實每位學生都能獲利的投資模型。','Peter’s skills account examines tasks, supervision and outcomes. The cash account includes housing, moving, commuting and job-search costs, with income based on an actual offer. The time account weighs career exploration against later graduation. This is an educational perspective, not a validated model guaranteeing a financial return.'),('未找到實習也要預先了解退路。Surrey官方列本科實習確認期限為二年級結束的8月31日；結束搜尋而未獲職位者，應聯絡團隊轉到不含實習的課程版本。仍在招聘程序中的個案可另詢團隊，不能將這所學校的程序推廣成全英統一規則。','Plan for an unsuccessful search. Surrey gives August 31 at the end of year two as the undergraduate confirmation deadline. Students ending their search without a position should contact the team about transfer to the non-placement course. Cases still in recruitment may be discussed individually; this is not a UK-wide rule.'),('學生可先分析三個真實職缺所需能力，家長則向學校索取實習年費用與轉換規則，建立不依賴未確定薪資的預算。原生粉專已核對至11月5日，只有這篇尚未匯入；11月6日善意文章與11月5日UCAS文章已刊，不重複匯入。','Students can analyse the skills required by three real vacancies; parents can request placement fees and transfer rules and budget without unconfirmed pay. The native page was reviewed back to November 5. Only this article was new; the November 6 kindness and November 5 UCAS posts were already imported.')]
