r['studyAbroadPrepared']=write('diy','bath-management-placement-year-course-choice','Bath實習年選校練習：先看課程，再算多一年成本','Choosing a Bath management placement year: course first, then costs','Bath校園故事延伸為選校問題：實習長度、雇主甄選、薪資與未取得職位的安排要分開核對。','Use Bath’s campus and placement model to examine duration, employer selection, pay and the consequences of an unsuccessful search.',[
('從校園走向工作','From campus to work','Bath管理學院以四年制課程中的實習年連接學術與職場；官方頁列第三年12個月安排。照片中的校園是真實資料照，但照片無法證明每位學生都能拿到理想職缺。選校時應先讀具體學位課程，不能把學院的一般介紹套到所有科系。','Bath’s School of Management connects academic study with work through a twelve-month third-year placement in four-year degrees. The photograph is a real campus archive image, but cannot establish access to a preferred employer. Read the specific degree rather than generalise the school’s model to every subject.'),
('將支援和保證分開','Distinguish support from guarantees','Bath明列不保證職位或薪資；Surrey的申請說明也顯示雇主有自己的甄選程序。比較學校時，可以列出履歷支持、面試練習與職缺取得方式，再問自己是否準備投入求職；不要將設有實習團隊等同學校已替你取得聘書。','Bath does not guarantee a position or pay, while Surrey’s application guidance also describes employer selection. Compare CV support, interview practice and vacancy access, then assess the work required from the student. A placement team is not an employment offer.'),
('做兩種預算','Make two budgets','本刊建議比較有確定有薪聘書與尚無收入的兩種情境，列入實習年學費、房租、搬家與通勤。這是規劃練習，不是個人財務建議或報酬保證。用留學DIY導航整理學校，再回到官方課程頁確認當年入學、實習與轉換條件。','Our planning exercise compares a confirmed paid offer with a no-income scenario, including placement tuition, rent, moving and commuting. It is not personalised financial advice or a return guarantee. Use the DIY guide to organise institutions, then verify intake, placement and transfer conditions on official course pages.')],[('Bath — official placement model',bath),('Surrey — comparative employer-selection guidance',surrey)],'study-abroad',dict(category=t('留學DIY導航','Study abroad DIY'),country=t('英國','United Kingdom'),topic='uk'))
